# Bounded representative-course timing route. This follows the normal GP menus,
# selects King Cup / Fire Field, holds centered acceleration long enough for the
# race-time probe and perf telemetry to sample the live course, then exits cleanly.
WAITTITLE 3600
PRESS START 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS RIGHT 3
WAIT 30
PRESS RIGHT 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 8 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 9 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 1 5400
LOG fire_field_timing_start
INPUT A 0 0 2400
LOG fire_field_timing_end
QUIT
